{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "134",
 "name": "Blighted Tangle",
 "file": "Map134_Blighted_Tangle.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":0,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["The surroundings grow dimmer, the flora itself seeming more monotone than at the entrance to this bizarre garden.  Moving into the heart of the wood, everything seems to shift from vibrant, explosive colors into chalky, dull greys."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map133_Adders_Coil.xml"},
  {"id":2,"x":20,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["A soft buzzing sound emanates from a hollow beneath one of the silverwillows crowding the banks of a small stream.  Grass grows throughout, thinning and losing color as it approaches the waterline.  A narrow trail leads southerly towards a healthier region of the forest."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":3,"x":20,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Stunted trees press in from all sides, grabbing at hair and clothing.  Tatters of grey moss caught in the branches flutter like shrouds snatched from the restless dead.  In curious contrast to the distorted trees, a lush carpet of black widow's lace grass provides a gloriously dark setting for colorful mounds of flowering adder's tongue."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":4,"x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["The limbs of elder trees interweave overhead, blocking out any glimpse of the sky.  Somehow, a thick undergrowth of creeping vines and pale ferns thrive in the perpetual dusk, threatening to block the path at every turn.  Pale wisps of mists drift like aimless wraiths through the tangle of vines and trees."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":5,"x":20,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Thorned vines slither up and around the ancient oak trees like fanged vipers.  Broken, rotting limbs lay scattered over the ground like gangrenous appendages.  Standing out in the drear wood, red-capped mushrooms push up through the carpet of decomposing leaves, thriving in the moist decay."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":6,"x":40,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Festooned with ropy grey blankets of moss, the gnarled limbs of an enormous oak stretch overhead.  Deep gouges, the width of a finger or more, mar the bark of the forest giant.  The edges of the gouges are weathered, proving the damage occurred some time ago, yet the tree still weeps viscous dribbles of sap."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":7,"x":60,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Spidery vines smother the sloping ground, tangling about the trunks of browning pines.  Murky light barely penetrates the layers of leaves and boughs.  A whispering rustle accompanies the slightest disturbance in the air.  The air is ripe with the scent of damp earth and faint corruption."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":8,"x":80,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Skeletons of once-thriving trees crowd together, their gnarled limbs sculpted by the harsh mountain winds.  Tangles of thorny red-tinted vines snake around the trunks and drape the chalky grey trees with a vibrant explosion of color."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":9,"x":60,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["To the north, the immense mass of the mountain emerges from pale wisps of mist.  Icy fingers of water trickle down from the snowpack above into small pools.  Blighted trees huddle close together as if commiserating with one another over their plight.  Occasional blasts of frigid air set limbs clattering against one another, raining desiccated leaves down to the forest floor."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":10,"x":80,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Grey and lifeless, a pervasive air of decay hangs over this region of the woods.  A number of trees lean precariously against one another, worn beyond endurance by the blight.  Limbs shattered, one pine has succumbed utterly and crashed to the forest floor.  A sickly growth of fungus has sprung up along its scaly bark."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":11,"x":60,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Draped with tattered grey moss, the barren trees resemble skeletal black arms clad in the rotting remnants of winding sheets.  Reaching through the icy fog shrouding the forest, the dense tangle of vegetation forms an impenetrable barrier blocking passage at nearly every turn."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":12,"x":40,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["A narrow track ends abruptly where a massive shoulder of black granite juts from the side of the mountain.  Part of the cliff has collapsed, leaving a great jumble of fallen rock that partially blocks a dark cave mouth.  Sheltered from the sun's cruel light by the stony slopes, a thick blanket of yellow-green lichen spreads over much of the area.","A narrow track ends abruptly where a massive shoulder of black granite juts from the side of the mountain.  Part of the cliff has collapsed, leaving a great jumble of fallen rock that partially blocks a dark cave mouth.  A thick blanket of yellow-green lichen spreads over much of the area, aglow with a dim patches of phosphorescent light."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":13,"x":20,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Cave Mouth","descriptions":["The cave mouth opens into a broad interior passage that extends out of sight in the darkness to the north.  Slow drops of water fall from the ceiling, striking the floor with a splat that echoes off the rock walls.  A low, breathy chittering accompanies the rustling of leathery wings overhead.  Underfoot, bat guano covers the floor and holds the tracks of some large, bipedal creature."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map135_Dark_Burrows.xml"},
  {"id":14,"x":80,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Writhing like snakes, wisps of yellowish mist drift up off a rivulet to the east.  Half sunk in the soft boggy soil, storm-shattered trees lay strewn across the clearing whether broken by wind or ice is hard to say.  Rotting stumps, covered with thick shelves of scabrous fungus, rear out of the deadfall."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":15,"x":20,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["A huge oak tree dominates the center of the clearing, lifting its great branches up to the sky.  Crone's hair moss hangs in clumps from the barren limbs while gnarled roots snake out in all directions to trip the unwary.  Wan light filters down to cast dappled shadows on the ground."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":16,"x":40,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Pallid streaks of daylight pierce the canopy to cast dappled shadows on the ground.  Crone's hair moss hangs in clumps from the barren, twisted limbs of a massive oak.  Gnarled roots reach out in all directions from the base of the hulking tree to trip the unwary.  From somewhere nearby comes the muted sound of running water."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":17,"x":60,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Barely audible, the trickling of water whispers seductively from its unseen source.  Lush green vines armed with red thorns smother the eastern flank of the massive oak tree, yielding grudgingly to the grey moss swaying from the leafless limbs.  Rocky soils shows dark amidst scraggly patches of thin grass."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":18,"x":60,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Cloyingly thick, the omnipresent stench of the stream permeates the area with a sickening miasma.  Icy fingers of mist slither around once prospering trees, as if groping blindly for victims to choke.  Dim reflections float on the dark waters, shattering and reforming with the slow moving current."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":19,"x":80,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Hollow with distance, throaty ululations worry at the edge of hearing and then vanish.  The gnarled and diseased limbs of oak trees are being slowly strangled by black-thorned vines covered with blooms resembling purple spiders.  A small patch of weeds clusters around a large rock jutting from the ground."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":20,"x":100,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Sickly yellow-green scum covers the surface of a small pool.  Skeletal trees, bereft of leaves and life, lean precariously over the water like drunkards about to fall into a gutter.  The blight is especially virulent here, coating the ground and trees with a thick, oozing fungus reeking of rot."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":21,"x":100,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Thin veils of mist chill the air.  Riddled with splotches of fungus, the scaly black trunks of pine trees rise up all around.  Overhead, thick branches lock together and support a tangled mat of moss and vines.  Brown needles cover the ground, hiding tripping hazards like protruding roots and treacherous stones."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":22,"x":80,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Chill tendrils of mist rise from a malodorous stream coursing through the tangle.  The yellowish fog eddies eerily around the tree trunks, swirling in response to shifts in the air currents and movement of any living thing.  The bare limbs of sickly silverwillow trees stretch across the path, as if poised to scratch or ensnare the unwary."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":23,"x":100,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Icy fingers of water trickle down the sheer cliff and form a fetid rivulet that wends its way sluggishly south.  Chill winds tear at the brittle branches of dying silverwillows huddling close to the slow moving water.  Rotting leaves and branches form a loose tangle of debris in the rivulet, caught on stones slick with slimy black moss."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":24,"x":100,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["What light filters through the dense canopy scarcely penetrates the gloomy shadows beneath the trees.  The trunks of the towering trees are splotched with some type of sickly fungus.  Reeking of death and decay, the forest floor is carpeted with dismal grey-green leaves on top and black rot underneath."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":25,"x":100,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["A vast tangle of root and limbs, the wood is painted in shades of chalky grey splashed with splotches of reddish black where fungus oozes over the blighted trees.  Drifting up from the ground, yellowish mist thickens and thins inexplicably while carrying the scents of damp and decay."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":26,"x":80,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["Skeletal tree limbs stretch imploringly up to the sky, withered leaves clinging tenaciously despite strong mountain winds.  A roiling mist clings to the surface of the stream coursing through the oaks and silverwillows.  The slick rocks bordering the stream are streaked with strangely luminescent lichen."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":27,"x":120,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["A ridge heaves up sharply from the forest floor, a long rise of stone and earth curved like a claw.  Trees cling to its flanks, their leafy canopies shrouding the world in grey twilight.  Smelling of crisp pine and the less pleasant scent of decay, pale mists rise from the black earth and curl through the scatter of rocks and trees.","A ridge heaves up sharply from the forest floor, a long rise of stone and earth curved like a claw.  Trees cling to its flanks, their leafy canopies shrouding the world in darkness.  Smelling of crisp pine and the less pleasant scent of decay, pale mists rise from the black earth and curl through the scatter of rocks and trees."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":28,"x":140,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Canopied Trail","descriptions":["Towering ironwoods spread their canopies over the stunted oaks and scrubby pines, the sparsely leafed limbs interlacing in a web of rot-riddled wood that hangs low over the narrow ridge rising up from the forest floor.  A few of the lower branches of the trees are broken, as if something large had passed this way recently."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map136_VelaTohr_Overlook.xml"}
 ],
 "labels": [
  {"text":"Deadwood Dryad","x":10,"y":70,"z":0},
  {"text":"Blightwater Nyad","x":10,"y":60,"z":0}
 ]
}
